WEBVTT

00:00:07.190 --> 00:00:13.780
<i>A new kind of disease has been 
spreading among young people.</i>

00:00:14.370 --> 00:00:17.530
<i>Following prolonged periods 
of Internet usage,</i>

00:00:17.530 --> 00:00:23.330
<i>sufferers develop a pathological 
dependence on the Internet.</i>

00:00:24.070 --> 00:00:28.200
<i>Experts have named this 
disease "Internet Addiction."</i>

00:00:28.980 --> 00:00:34.940
<i>In order to get these addicted 
youngsters back on the right track</i>

00:00:34.940 --> 00:00:39.140
<i>and reform them into independent, 
self-respecting adults,</i>

00:00:39.730 --> 00:00:45.890
<i>the Elite Reeducation Academy, a civilian 
educational facility, was created.</i>

00:00:46.910 --> 00:00:53.730
<i>It is a place to help young 
people to grow up right.</i>

00:02:27.000 --> 00:02:32.960
Episode 7
A Decision at Rock Bottom

00:02:28.100 --> 00:02:29.090
Listen.

00:02:29.090 --> 00:02:31.170
This is your final chance.

00:02:31.500 --> 00:02:33.170
Take the naked pictures.

00:02:35.080 --> 00:02:37.330
If you won't be my dog,

00:02:37.330 --> 00:02:39.240
you'll be my enemy.

00:02:39.680 --> 00:02:41.940
Choose which one you prefer.

00:02:42.250 --> 00:02:43.600
I...

00:02:58.710 --> 00:03:00.300
S-Sorry...

00:03:00.300 --> 00:03:04.730
Hey, isn't that Moku-chan?
 You tried to escape by digging a tunnel.

00:03:04.730 --> 00:03:07.300
Now that you're back, I hope 
you'll give us some business.

00:03:07.300 --> 00:03:10.840
With you gone, sales have been terrible.

00:03:12.960 --> 00:03:15.330
It takes real guts to run away.

00:03:15.330 --> 00:03:18.810
I hear he got a total tongue-lashing 
from the instructors.

00:03:34.720 --> 00:03:37.590
What? No allowance, eh?

00:03:37.590 --> 00:03:39.860
Then how are you gonna serve me?

00:03:38.870 --> 00:03:40.170
Yeah.

00:03:40.170 --> 00:03:41.620
A pig should act like a pig.

00:03:41.620 --> 00:03:43.740
Eat your food off the ground. Go on!

00:03:46.770 --> 00:03:48.510
What are you doing?

00:03:49.560 --> 00:03:52.170
If you're going to eat, 
go to the dining hall!

00:03:52.500 --> 00:03:55.160
H-Head Instructor Shian...

00:03:55.520 --> 00:03:56.960
Trash!

00:03:56.960 --> 00:03:58.170
Get out of my sight!

00:03:58.440 --> 00:03:59.680
Head Instructor!

00:03:59.680 --> 00:04:01.820
They're teasing me again...

00:04:01.820 --> 00:04:03.040
Please help me.

00:04:03.040 --> 00:04:04.250
I'm begging you.

00:04:10.080 --> 00:04:11.680
Help you?

00:04:14.470 --> 00:04:16.820
I hate people who run away.

00:04:16.820 --> 00:04:19.060
I thought you were obeying the rules.

00:04:19.060 --> 00:04:20.700
I thought you had reformed.

00:04:21.000 --> 00:04:23.170
Yet you tried to escape...

00:04:23.170 --> 00:04:24.150
It's outrageous!

00:04:24.450 --> 00:04:26.700
You want more of a beating, do you?

00:04:36.940 --> 00:04:39.150
I don't want to run.

00:04:40.220 --> 00:04:42.200
I don't want to run, but...

00:04:42.900 --> 00:04:44.170
If this keeps up,

00:04:44.470 --> 00:04:46.880
they'll kill me.

00:04:47.350 --> 00:04:50.320
If this keeps up, I really will be killed.

00:04:53.650 --> 00:04:54.740
Listen.

00:04:54.740 --> 00:04:57.180
Whether we get out of here alive 
or not all depends on you.

00:04:56.080 --> 00:04:57.180
I'm sorry.

00:04:57.180 --> 00:05:00.030
I don't want to die, Big Bro.

00:05:22.600 --> 00:05:24.290
I'll just take one.

00:05:24.290 --> 00:05:26.070
Will that do?

00:05:29.160 --> 00:05:30.430
Fine.

00:05:31.730 --> 00:05:34.310
Then promise me...

00:05:34.310 --> 00:05:36.000
As long as they don't 
get in your way again,

00:05:36.000 --> 00:05:37.570
you won't hurt them.

00:05:38.640 --> 00:05:41.360
This is no time for you to 
be worrying about the women.

00:05:41.720 --> 00:05:42.940
Get to it already.

00:05:58.600 --> 00:05:59.420
Hoku!

00:06:03.010 --> 00:06:04.160
Shiori!

00:06:08.810 --> 00:06:09.980
Do it.

00:06:19.020 --> 00:06:20.060
Shiori.

00:06:20.060 --> 00:06:21.450
Try to endure it.

00:06:21.450 --> 00:06:22.680
This is for your own good.

00:06:29.100 --> 00:06:31.100
I can't undress her like this.

00:06:31.100 --> 00:06:32.610
Release her.

00:06:52.610 --> 00:06:53.680
Run!

00:06:55.870 --> 00:06:57.680
Get to the instructors!

00:07:05.860 --> 00:07:07.880
Shall we go after them?

00:07:08.800 --> 00:07:09.940
No.

00:07:09.940 --> 00:07:11.290
Let them go.

00:07:13.240 --> 00:07:16.020
Now you've really done it, Hibiki.

00:07:16.020 --> 00:07:20.110
I gave you a chance and you threw it away.

00:07:20.110 --> 00:07:21.290
That's fine.

00:07:22.400 --> 00:07:23.340
Shiori.

00:07:23.340 --> 00:07:25.570
I'm going to do what I want to you, too.

00:07:25.570 --> 00:07:28.630
If you want to blame someone, 
blame this idiot here.

00:07:28.630 --> 00:07:31.100
Hibiki is a jinx on you.

00:07:32.200 --> 00:07:33.400
Hey, Shin.

00:07:33.400 --> 00:07:35.690
If you have a problem with me, 
take it out on me!

00:07:38.100 --> 00:07:42.690
You actually think pathetic trash 
like you can protect a girl?

00:07:43.690 --> 00:07:47.710
Just because you became a leader and 
got some praise from an instructor,

00:07:47.710 --> 00:07:50.700
you think you're hot stuff, do you?

00:07:51.490 --> 00:07:53.140
You're the real trash!

00:07:53.140 --> 00:07:54.530
Explain this to me.

00:07:54.530 --> 00:07:56.570
You lied to me about where 
the exchanges went down,

00:07:56.570 --> 00:07:58.990
and the guys from class one 
knew where I was.

00:07:58.990 --> 00:08:01.660
And now you're trying to make Shiori hate me.

00:08:01.660 --> 00:08:05.170
Why should I swear loyalty 
to someone like you?!

00:08:05.360 --> 00:08:09.170
That's hardly enough cause 
to talk back to your master.

00:08:09.580 --> 00:08:12.010
I don't need superficial loyalty like yours.

00:08:12.010 --> 00:08:15.170
The only reason you wag 
your tail for your master

00:08:15.170 --> 00:08:18.170
is to serve your own petty needs.

00:08:18.310 --> 00:08:22.830
In the end, you're just a fool who 
flounders around for the sake of a woman.

00:08:22.830 --> 00:08:25.610
I forgave everything you'd done until today.

00:08:27.790 --> 00:08:28.970
You...

00:08:28.970 --> 00:08:32.300
You were trying to torment me from the start?

00:08:32.300 --> 00:08:33.580
Damn you.

00:08:33.580 --> 00:08:36.020
You're completely rotten!

00:08:37.200 --> 00:08:39.130
You're absolutely right.

00:08:39.130 --> 00:08:40.420
Bring him.

00:08:43.200 --> 00:08:44.680
Hey, you people!

00:08:44.680 --> 00:08:46.010
What are you doing in the bathroom?

00:08:46.600 --> 00:08:48.170
Bro Bin!

00:08:48.580 --> 00:08:49.960
What's the deal?

00:08:49.960 --> 00:08:51.520
I want to hear all about it.

00:08:51.520 --> 00:08:52.680
No need to ask.

00:08:54.370 --> 00:08:56.170
It's obvious, isn't it?

00:08:57.900 --> 00:09:00.570
Is Hibiki in here?

00:09:01.080 --> 00:09:03.180
I-Instructor. I'm here.

00:09:03.690 --> 00:09:04.890
Yes.

00:09:04.890 --> 00:09:06.890
Did you need to speak with me?

00:09:06.890 --> 00:09:08.540
I want to file a complaint!

00:09:08.540 --> 00:09:11.480
Shin here was making students fight

00:09:11.480 --> 00:09:13.270
and using those beneath 
him to harass the girlsー

00:09:13.270 --> 00:09:15.200
You shut your lying mouth!

00:09:15.600 --> 00:09:19.660
We had a report that you caused trouble 
and obtained a cell phone.

00:09:19.870 --> 00:09:22.470
I... I didn't!

00:09:25.490 --> 00:09:27.030
Then what's this?

00:09:28.800 --> 00:09:31.660
Let me tell you one last thing.

00:09:32.210 --> 00:09:35.680
Vice Head Instructor Ryo 
is in charge of class six.

00:09:36.620 --> 00:09:37.750
Understand now?

00:09:38.500 --> 00:09:41.460
He just happened to pick up Jun's cell phone.

00:09:41.460 --> 00:09:44.520
It's password-protected, 
so he can't use it, of course.

00:09:44.780 --> 00:09:47.990
Yesterday, my dog beat Wudo

00:09:47.990 --> 00:09:50.150
and earned the head instructor's trust.

00:09:50.150 --> 00:09:52.300
Now he fancies himself a hero.

00:09:52.300 --> 00:09:54.830
He wants to give those phones
 over to the head instructor.

00:09:54.830 --> 00:09:56.660
Given everything that's 
been happening lately,

00:09:56.660 --> 00:09:58.970
knowing Head Instructor Shian,

00:09:58.970 --> 00:10:02.410
the next time he finds a student with 
a cell phone, he'll probably destroy it.

00:10:02.410 --> 00:10:04.600
Forget all that. Where's Hibiki?

00:10:04.600 --> 00:10:07.270
Calm down. I've taken measures.

00:10:07.880 --> 00:10:09.850
Will you work with me?

00:10:09.850 --> 00:10:13.690
You'll get the cell phone, 
and I'll have a little game with my dog.

00:10:13.690 --> 00:10:14.760
What do you think?

00:10:16.240 --> 00:10:17.700
Shin...

00:10:18.180 --> 00:10:21.940
You set up a honey trap 
using female students to seduce male ones.

00:10:22.360 --> 00:10:25.170
And you threatened them, in order to 
get them to do as you said, right?

00:10:25.680 --> 00:10:27.540
What do you have to say for yourself?

00:10:29.690 --> 00:10:30.900
Fine.

00:10:30.900 --> 00:10:33.040
We have the perpetrator and the proof.

00:10:33.040 --> 00:10:35.610
You'll receive your punishment shortly.

00:10:36.200 --> 00:10:38.980
The perpetrator, Hibiki, lied to an instructor,

00:10:38.980 --> 00:10:40.940
threatened a student, and broke school rules.

00:10:40.940 --> 00:10:43.960
For this serious breach, 
he'll get two weeks in solitary.

00:10:43.960 --> 00:10:47.060
Accomplices Shiori, Akane, and Hoku

00:10:47.060 --> 00:10:49.090
will get five additional 
kilometers to run daily,

00:10:49.090 --> 00:10:50.670
and one month of bathroom cleaning duty.

00:10:54.430 --> 00:10:58.050
You've caused a lot of 
trouble for a newbie brat.

00:10:58.050 --> 00:11:00.650
Enjoy your time in solitary.

00:11:00.650 --> 00:11:02.680
You'll go mad within a week.

00:11:02.680 --> 00:11:04.700
You stuck-up trash!

00:11:14.790 --> 00:11:16.850
<i>Shiori...</i>

00:11:17.320 --> 00:11:18.380
Thanks.

00:11:21.150 --> 00:11:23.500
But stay away from me from now on.

00:11:23.850 --> 00:11:25.770
I never want to see you again.

00:11:30.020 --> 00:11:31.530
I...

00:11:33.290 --> 00:11:36.490
Acting hot over a girl and 
ending up beaten to a pulp...

00:11:36.490 --> 00:11:37.180
What a fool.

00:11:37.300 --> 00:11:41.180
Just because he became Shin's dog, 
he thought he was so special.

00:11:41.180 --> 00:11:42.670
Too bad he was wrong.

00:11:42.670 --> 00:11:46.190
He's a coward, just a glorified errand boy.

00:11:54.850 --> 00:11:55.640
Hey!

00:11:55.640 --> 00:11:56.680
Get up now!

00:11:56.680 --> 00:11:57.820
Are you exhausted already?

00:11:57.820 --> 00:11:58.940
Get running!

00:11:58.940 --> 00:11:59.600
Listen up.

00:11:59.600 --> 00:12:02.200
If you don't place in the next tournament,
 I'm throwing you off the team!

00:12:02.200 --> 00:12:04.320
Hibiki-chan, open the door!

00:12:04.320 --> 00:12:06.220
Where did these horrible scores come from?

00:12:06.220 --> 00:12:07.320
Hibiki-chan!

00:12:07.330 --> 00:12:08.940
Explain yourself!

00:12:09.260 --> 00:12:12.250
I'm working my fingers to the bone every day,

00:12:12.250 --> 00:12:13.970
and this is how you repay me?

00:12:13.970 --> 00:12:16.670
All you do all day is run...

00:12:16.670 --> 00:12:18.850
What are you going to do with yourself?

00:12:17.000 --> 00:12:18.840
Shut up...

00:12:18.840 --> 00:12:21.380
Shut up, shut up, shut up!

00:12:18.850 --> 00:12:21.380
How did you end up this way?

00:12:21.380 --> 00:12:22.930
Hey, kid.

00:12:22.930 --> 00:12:24.560
Come play with us awhile.

00:12:24.560 --> 00:12:26.440
You need to relax from time to time.

00:12:26.440 --> 00:12:28.380
Come on, step inside.

00:12:30.980 --> 00:12:32.370
Damn it...

00:12:32.370 --> 00:12:35.950
Die, die... all of you, die!

00:12:38.190 --> 00:12:39.440
Damn it!

00:12:40.720 --> 00:12:42.100
One more time!

00:12:44.330 --> 00:12:47.820
<i>Damn it... Damn it!</i>

00:12:49.380 --> 00:12:52.580
My teachers, my friends,

00:12:52.580 --> 00:12:54.610
my family, my teammates...

00:12:54.610 --> 00:12:56.460
They're all crap!

00:12:58.050 --> 00:13:00.230
I'll never trust anyone again!

00:13:00.230 --> 00:13:02.170
In this world full of violence,

00:13:02.170 --> 00:13:04.680
only the strong can be righteous.

00:13:04.680 --> 00:13:06.730
I... Hibiki...

00:13:06.730 --> 00:13:08.690
am reborn as of today.

00:13:08.900 --> 00:13:11.300
I don't care if I fall into darkness...

00:13:11.300 --> 00:13:13.800
I don't care if I have to sell my soul.

00:13:13.810 --> 00:13:18.180
I have only one goal.

00:13:18.800 --> 00:13:20.200
There. You understand?

00:13:36.700 --> 00:13:38.160
Hey, Shin.

00:13:40.090 --> 00:13:42.010
Instructor Ryo.

00:13:42.010 --> 00:13:44.050
What brings you here?

00:13:56.230 --> 00:13:59.400
Seven Years Ago

00:14:00.000 --> 00:14:02.980
Die, you damned cops!

00:14:07.880 --> 00:14:09.250
I'm gonna be killed!

00:14:09.250 --> 00:14:10.730
We're all gonna be killed!

00:14:10.730 --> 00:14:13.140
There's a spy! They sold us out!

00:14:13.520 --> 00:14:14.490
Calm down.

00:14:14.900 --> 00:14:18.000
An inspector in the narcotics division 
needs to be able to handle this.

00:14:18.460 --> 00:14:21.270
But, Bro, there are too many of them.

00:14:21.270 --> 00:14:22.710
They're gonna surround us.

00:14:22.710 --> 00:14:24.980
How are we supposed to get away?

00:14:26.040 --> 00:14:28.980
We need to hold out until 
reinforcements from HQ arrive.

00:14:28.980 --> 00:14:30.680
We're almost out of bullets.

00:14:30.680 --> 00:14:31.760
I'm at my limit!

00:14:31.770 --> 00:14:32.920
Bro...

00:14:33.260 --> 00:14:35.250
I don't wanna die!

00:14:35.930 --> 00:14:38.460
Idiot! Quit your whining!

00:14:38.460 --> 00:14:40.190
We're not gonna die in a place like this!

00:14:49.880 --> 00:14:51.480
Let's split up.

00:14:51.480 --> 00:14:52.860
I'll hold them off here.

00:14:52.860 --> 00:14:54.610
You break through and 
call for reinforcements.

00:14:54.610 --> 00:14:55.990
We've got to arrest them, no matter what.

00:14:55.990 --> 00:14:57.490
Bro, I...

00:14:57.490 --> 00:14:59.180
You're a police officer.

00:14:59.180 --> 00:15:01.950
The success of our mission relies on you.

00:15:01.950 --> 00:15:03.000
Go!

00:15:34.800 --> 00:15:36.080
Bro...

00:15:41.310 --> 00:15:44.000
B-Bro... no...

00:15:45.380 --> 00:15:46.680
I'm sorry!

00:15:46.680 --> 00:15:49.460
I... I was too scared to break through.

00:15:49.460 --> 00:15:51.780
I didn't want to die.

00:15:51.780 --> 00:15:53.850
Bro...

00:15:53.850 --> 00:15:58.250
Please... forgive me...

00:15:58.570 --> 00:16:01.500
You cowardly asshole...

00:16:02.380 --> 00:16:04.780
I trusted you...

00:16:04.780 --> 00:16:08.480
Give me my life back!

00:16:20.010 --> 00:16:21.490
Bro...

00:16:26.500 --> 00:16:27.490
Go away!

00:16:27.490 --> 00:16:29.000
It's all your fault!

00:16:29.000 --> 00:16:34.300
How dare you survive when he—
when your whole team died?

00:16:34.300 --> 00:16:35.930
I don't want your apologies!

00:16:35.930 --> 00:16:38.100
Just give him back to me!

00:16:38.980 --> 00:16:41.470
My family is destroyed.

00:16:41.480 --> 00:16:44.480
My son and daughter never come home...

00:16:44.480 --> 00:16:47.930
I want to die, too!

00:17:10.000 --> 00:17:11.160
Gan!

00:17:11.690 --> 00:17:13.620
You didn't even go to 
your father's funeral.

00:17:13.620 --> 00:17:15.510
What are you doing here?

00:17:15.510 --> 00:17:17.980
Your mother's grief aggravated 
her chronic condition,

00:17:17.980 --> 00:17:19.720
and she's in the hospital 
with your grandmother.

00:17:19.720 --> 00:17:21.480
How can you play games at a time like this?!

00:17:21.900 --> 00:17:23.970
Could you even look at your father?!

00:17:29.620 --> 00:17:31.480
Are you listening to a word I say?

00:17:31.480 --> 00:17:33.330
You're the son of a hero!

00:17:33.330 --> 00:17:35.250
You can't give up on yourself!

00:17:37.000 --> 00:17:38.240
Hero my ass!

00:17:38.240 --> 00:17:41.070
That bastard abandoned his family...

00:17:42.000 --> 00:17:45.000
Ever since I was a kid, 
I hardly ever even saw him.

00:17:45.000 --> 00:17:46.810
He never did a damn thing for me.

00:17:46.810 --> 00:17:48.490
How's he my father, exactly?

00:17:48.800 --> 00:17:51.810
Police officers don't make much money,

00:17:51.810 --> 00:17:54.600
but our family was under constant threat.

00:17:54.600 --> 00:17:56.700
We had to move over and over again.

00:17:56.700 --> 00:17:59.010
He doesn't even know how old I am!

00:17:59.200 --> 00:18:00.910
You call him a hero?

00:18:00.910 --> 00:18:04.720
When I was teased and bullied at school,

00:18:04.720 --> 00:18:06.270
what did he do to help me?

00:18:06.270 --> 00:18:08.170
That "big hero" of yours...

00:18:08.170 --> 00:18:11.440
You don't you even know the life 
he put his family through!

00:18:12.180 --> 00:18:16.490
What's a police officer really good for, huh?

00:18:22.380 --> 00:18:25.000
Gan, hey! Wake up!

00:18:25.000 --> 00:18:28.050
Someone call an ambulance!

00:18:28.050 --> 00:18:30.010
Hey! Gan!

00:18:30.010 --> 00:18:31.440
Speak to me!

00:18:31.440 --> 00:18:33.010
Open your eyes!

00:18:33.690 --> 00:18:35.520
Gan!

00:18:40.040 --> 00:18:42.860
You would think a hero's son
 would be a real man.

00:18:42.860 --> 00:18:45.000
What exactly happened to Kai's son?

00:18:45.450 --> 00:18:48.260
I heard he has a daughter, too.

00:18:48.260 --> 00:18:49.650
And she's missing, too?

00:18:49.650 --> 00:18:50.690
Yes.

00:18:50.690 --> 00:18:51.760
Listen, Shian.

00:18:51.760 --> 00:18:56.190
Everyone recognizes all you've done 
for Kai's family.

00:18:56.190 --> 00:18:57.810
Kai is a hero.

00:18:57.810 --> 00:19:03.910
We raised funds and gave it to his mother 
and wife for their hospital fees.

00:19:05.040 --> 00:19:07.930
There are limits to what we can do, though.

00:19:08.490 --> 00:19:11.800
His family will understand.

00:19:11.800 --> 00:19:12.990
Liar!

00:19:12.990 --> 00:19:14.560
Wh-What?

00:19:14.560 --> 00:19:16.540
You must know, Chief.

00:19:16.540 --> 00:19:18.540
Bro died because of a spy!

00:19:18.540 --> 00:19:19.760
There were no reinforcements!

00:19:20.200 --> 00:19:21.850
Silence, Shian!

00:19:21.850 --> 00:19:23.720
Don't say such irresponsible things!

00:19:24.180 --> 00:19:26.160
You're the sole survivor.

00:19:26.160 --> 00:19:27.230
People are watching you.

00:19:27.630 --> 00:19:29.990
Don't stick your nose 
where it doesn't belong!

00:19:32.800 --> 00:19:34.130
Damn...

00:19:34.130 --> 00:19:35.360
I can't do this anymore!

00:19:35.360 --> 00:19:36.980
Hey, wait, Shian!

00:19:36.980 --> 00:19:38.630
Come back!

00:19:38.630 --> 00:19:39.980
Have you gone mad?

00:19:40.570 --> 00:19:41.970
Hey, Shian!

00:19:56.420 --> 00:19:59.510
She's in the suite on the hotel's top floor.

00:19:59.510 --> 00:20:01.510
I prepared a key card.

00:20:01.910 --> 00:20:04.010
Thanks, Rin.

00:20:04.010 --> 00:20:05.880
Not at all.

00:20:05.880 --> 00:20:07.730
I'd do anything for Bro's sake.

00:20:07.730 --> 00:20:09.560
Don't tell the chief.

00:20:10.050 --> 00:20:12.980
I know. I'll repay you for this.

00:20:19.830 --> 00:20:23.000
Feels so good... More...

00:20:28.620 --> 00:20:29.630
Harder!

00:20:38.580 --> 00:20:39.700
Hey...

00:20:40.600 --> 00:20:42.920
Your father and little brother are dead.

00:20:42.920 --> 00:20:44.470
You haven't been home.

00:20:44.470 --> 00:20:46.120
What are you doing here?

00:20:46.120 --> 00:20:48.790
Have you sold your soul to the devil, Jean?

00:20:49.800 --> 00:20:52.480
Wh-Who are you? How did you get in here?

00:20:54.480 --> 00:20:57.100
You're Shian, aren't you?

00:20:58.000 --> 00:21:00.010
My father told me about you.

00:21:00.820 --> 00:21:03.940
Your father would be heartbroken 
to know you were doing this...

00:21:03.940 --> 00:21:05.690
The daughter of a hero... doing...

00:21:05.690 --> 00:21:07.110
Doing what?

00:21:07.110 --> 00:21:08.510
He's dead.

00:21:08.510 --> 00:21:10.990
It's up to me how I live my life, isn't it?

00:21:10.990 --> 00:21:11.990
What?

00:21:11.990 --> 00:21:14.780
Hey, Jean. Who is this guy?

00:21:14.780 --> 00:21:17.100
Do you know each other?

00:21:18.400 --> 00:21:19.500
It hurts...

00:21:21.180 --> 00:21:22.500
My heart...

00:21:24.220 --> 00:21:27.010
Quickly, my medicine!

00:21:27.600 --> 00:21:30.350
My medicine... 
Bring me my medicine!

00:21:36.260 --> 00:21:37.910
Hey! What are you doing?

00:21:37.910 --> 00:21:38.970
Give him his medicine!

00:21:43.370 --> 00:21:44.480
Give me that medicine!

00:23:25.920 --> 00:23:39.930
<b>Next Episode Preview</b>

00:23:26.510 --> 00:23:29.840
Please! Torture me more! Please!

00:23:28.020 --> 00:23:29.840
If you want to atone,

00:23:29.840 --> 00:23:32.980
you can risk your life for it from now on.

00:23:33.720 --> 00:23:37.420
I'm sorry for worrying you. I'm fine.

00:23:33.720 --> 00:23:37.560
What, gone crazy after a week's confinement?

00:23:34.970 --> 00:23:39.930
Episode 8
Budding

00:23:37.420 --> 00:23:39.730
I feel wonderful, in fact.
